{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29e7b8778e0ed2a7021cb02b8a0e81956458db10fde0a41bd0e170fe972c31ef", "ja": "（静香とロコが、美術館に飾るチョコを作ることに\nなった。静香は机に向かって、何かをしている……）", "zh": "（静香和ROCO要一起制作一块摆在美术馆里的巧克力。静香正坐在桌前，不知道在做什么……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6f4fade66da30130cb71d2feb7775039af2edb463711965044e93fce27b1bbca", "ja": "お疲れ様、静香。机の上が随分賑やかだな。\n落書きがたくさんあるけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。桌上还真是热闹啊。\n虽然有好多涂鸦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "b63e2d7e409a88ffbe286659aa1a4666819b772d971a61b85253339d6743b217", "ja": "落書きじゃありません！\nこれは……劇場のみんなの似顔絵です！", "zh": "这不是涂鸦！\n这是……剧场里大家的肖像画！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1003_p", "source_sha256": "009a2aabef43927ab90e83f7e2ea2a71500a1c3d264b7baf716e3d49cfd35c84", "ja": "似顔絵……。\nそれにしては、画風がバラバラのような？", "zh": "肖像画……。\n不过这样看，画风似乎各不相同吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "d84cce6bc8ca62922d5450c79c2586463fcfecf6f28423db393a537a929db58a", "ja": "さっきまで、ロコと勝負してたんです。今度のお仕事で\nどちらがイラストを描くのか、決めようと思って。", "zh": "刚才我一直在和ROCO比赛。我们想决定下次的工作由谁来画插画。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1005_p", "source_sha256": "914f304253d25c3f4181011bd75a4e7161501756a763c5643d1ea46ed3ed1462", "ja": "ロコもいたのか。\nそれでいろんなテイストが。", "zh": "原来ROCO也在啊。难怪会有各种风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "9a158234923a4cf98bf65d75c073fed0f8a0a5a6c03f831c390cf9d947b0db18", "ja": "そういうことです！　でも、さすがロコですね。\n私も最高傑作で挑んだつもりだったんですが……。", "zh": "原来是这样！不过，不愧是ROCO呢。我也是抱着拿出最高杰作来挑战的打算……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "96bbf12a0c8d2ca577e3402316471b9ce6ae4af694da3d671fc4546f9b6668b1", "ja": "ロコのイラストも、本当にクオリティが高くて。\n決着をつけるのに、時間がかかってしまって。", "zh": "ROCO的插画质量也真的很高。为了分出胜负，花了不少时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1008_p", "source_sha256": "577718dc3b937b6c078ea78811b769092105c278c038802180860fef1e0f552a", "ja": "……そうか。いい勝負だったみたいだな。\nそれで、どうなったんだ？", "zh": "……这样啊。看来是一场精彩的较量呢。\n那么，结果怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "70c4d62a9a7764e45707ad202316995def3cb5a0b3e0e6276ed30b48b2fcdf60", "ja": "えっと、結果は……引き分けでした！", "zh": "呃，结果是……平局！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "76557cdf77a0c299c97a4ee970b6361d3ab182ddbf1f816d57108b75e854d944", "ja": "私もロコも、お互いのイラストに感動しちゃって……\n勝敗がつけられなかったんです。", "zh": "我和ROCO都被对方的插画打动了……\n没法分出胜负。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c3ff3974ce687ecbd0c758fac52702d479aebfb6c58bfe8d17e2c32f058e9968", "ja": "はは、引き分けか。\nでも本番のイラストは、どうするんだ？", "zh": "哈哈，平局啊。\n不过正式比赛的插画要怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "b15e0c4ae5c40fdf8183847a3732fee16333642f96f425a41b196c50233a31e5", "ja": "それが、ロコが譲ってくれたんです。私のイラストは\nアバンギャルドで、えっと……ヒューマンの……？", "zh": "是这样的，ROCO把机会让给我了。我的插画很前卫，呃……是关于人类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "05c97328f1ccb50137e9355457ea2c91722037b462d665cd4633c843a7ed0625", "ja": "……とにかく、たくさんほめてくれました！\nふふっ♪", "zh": "……总之，她夸了我好多句呢！\n呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1014_p", "source_sha256": "60776545974649f4d3a6e5ac8add5bb538c2a27e8ab9f3453bd908d3021647ec", "ja": "そうか。それじゃ美術館には、\n静香のイラストが飾られるわけだな。", "zh": "这样啊。那也就是说，美术馆里会展出静香的插画了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "0de75990340d83b8ca988a116532296e35dab7768cddd839462da351f3d763e4", "ja": "はい。みんなが驚くようなイラストを考えてみますね。\n本番までに、もっと練習しなきゃ……。", "zh": "好的。我会试着画一幅让大家都惊讶的插画。\n在正式演出前，还得多加练习才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0553_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "10062ef9ba7821bf219df63654de7e9441ba1b386365b2368804d8e6c5cfc09f", "ja": "あの！　{$P$}の絵を描いても\nいいですか？　今なら素敵に描ける自信があるんです♪", "zh": "那个！我可以画一张{$P$}的画吗？\n我现在有信心能画得很棒哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
